1
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,920
‪SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:38,920
‪ADAPTED FROM <i>‪JIA JIN CHAI</i>‪, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‪BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:50,920
Help!

4
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:53,040
Help!

5
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:56,320
Somebody!

6
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:58,240
Is anyone there? Help!

7
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:04,160
- Put out the fire!
- Help!

8
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:05,840
- Hurry!
- Help!

9
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:07,360
- Put out the fire!
- Help!

10
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:08,280
Hurry!

11
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:12,280
Hurry! Hurry!

12
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,120
BOOK PAVILION

13
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:14,680
Put out the fire!

14
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:15,920
Hurry!

15
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,160
- Hurry!
- Come on!

16
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,160
Hurry!

17
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:20,320
Over here! Hurry!

18
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,560
- Grandmother.
- This…

19
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:23,800
If you still see me as your grandmother,

20
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:24,920
- then shut your mouth right now.
- Over here!

21
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:25,880
Hurry up!

22
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,840
Hurry! Break that lock!

23
00:02:28,440 --> 00:02:29,800
- Get her out!
- Quick!

24
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:39,840
This way!

25
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:40,760
Hurry!

26
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:44,840
Hurry!

27
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:47,400
Why are there two Lady Raos?

28
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,080
You may all leave.

29
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:01,800
I was just about to tell you, Grandmother.

30
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,400
I was foolish and stubborn.

31
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:06,040
I tried to take my own life
before the wedding.

32
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:08,160
Aunt Heng'e felt sorry for me.

33
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,720
She feared forcing me
to marry into the Lu family

34
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,280
would only lead to disaster.

35
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:14,120
So she went to great lengths to find
this woman to take my place.

36
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:16,000
It was only meant to be temporary.

37
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:18,880
But Aunt Heng'e kept trying to persuade me
and made me see what was at stake.

38
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,560
Only then did I realize
my terrible mistake.

39
00:03:20,640 --> 00:03:22,080
I deeply regretted it.

40
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:23,920
I'd long wanted to go to
the Duke's Residence and beg forgiveness.

41
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:29,080
Mother, don't blame her.

42
00:03:29,160 --> 00:03:30,800
It was me. I didn't let her go.

43
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:33,040
Lord Lu was still ill,

44
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,800
and the Lu family was in turmoil.

45
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:36,360
If they learned the truth,

46
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:39,640
instead of bringing Lord Lu luck,
it might cost his life.

47
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:41,720
That would've been a grave sin, Mother.

48
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:43,960
When we heard Lord Lu had recovered,

49
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:46,520
I was overjoyed.

50
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:49,920
I planned
to secretly switch back during this visit.

51
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:53,440
But this woman wanted the wealth
and status of the Lu family.

52
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:55,560
She threatened to tell everyone
the whole truth.

53
00:03:55,640 --> 00:03:58,480
I had no choice but to lock her up.

54
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:01,520
Humiliated and furious,
she started hurling vile accusations,

55
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:03,520
threatening to ruin the Wei family's name!

56
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:07,160
I panicked, so I…

57
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:11,680
Grandmother, I was wrong. I was wrong.

58
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:13,120
Every word is a lie!

59
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:17,560
An orphan girl
has no right to threaten a noble lady.

60
00:04:17,640 --> 00:04:20,120
You were clearly trying to burn me alive!

61
00:04:35,840 --> 00:04:36,880
Mother.

62
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:43,320
A life was at stake. How could you dare?

63
00:04:46,320 --> 00:04:47,200
You knew about this too?

64
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,960
I was too timid to tell you.

65
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:54,720
Fine.

66
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:56,880
So you all pulled off
this whole deception,

67
00:04:57,880 --> 00:05:00,400
and I was the only one kept in the dark.

68
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:04,560
Do you have any respect for me at all?

69
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:08,240
Mother, we're family.

70
00:05:08,320 --> 00:05:11,320
No matter how badly we've erred,
we share one fate.

71
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:12,320
If one falls, we all suffer.

72
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:15,640
Lord Lu is here right now.

73
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,760
If he hears even a word of this,

74
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:20,120
there'll be serious trouble.

75
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:21,440
For the Wei family's
century-old good name,

76
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:24,000
this must not get out.

77
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:35,200
Yes. The Wei family's good name
comes first.

78
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:38,760
Mother can punish me
however you want later.

79
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:40,560
But this woman cannot live.

80
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,600
Keeping her alive
will only bring disaster.

81
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:46,960
Mother, you're too merciful to do it.

82
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:50,080
Then let me do it for you.

83
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:52,600
Grandmother! Please!

84
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,480
Save me! Please!

85
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:10,800
Drag her out, now!

86
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,320
My Lord!

87
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:24,840
My Lord!

88
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,760
Why the panic? Where is Rao?

89
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:32,080
My Lady suddenly felt dizzy in the garden.

90
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:35,280
I couldn't support her by myself,
so I hurried back for help.

91
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:40,920
Dowager Lady!

92
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,800
Dowager Lady.

93
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:48,840
I'm just a helpless orphan
with no family, power, or status.

94
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:52,000
The Wei family paid me 50,000 coins
to marry Lord Lu for luck,

95
00:06:52,080 --> 00:06:54,560
and spend my life
widowed in Lady Rao's place.

96
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:58,280
We agreed that from then on,
fate would decide my life,

97
00:06:58,360 --> 00:07:00,440
and the Wei family would stay out of it.

98
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:03,440
But Lord Lu survived.

99
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:05,640
So they changed their minds.

100
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:08,800
They tricked me here
and tried to kill me to keep me quiet.

101
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:12,560
Dowager Lady, Lady Rao and I
may share a face,

102
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,640
but we're nothing alike
in personalities or bearing.

103
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:15,680
BOOK PAVILION

104
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:17,520
Lord Lu is far too perceptive.

105
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:19,240
He and I became a couple.

106
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:21,760
We've spent every day and night together.

107
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:23,280
How could he not know the difference?

108
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:26,040
You… You've already shared his bed?

109
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:28,040
That's impossible!

110
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,360
Lu Zhuo only just recovered
from a grave illness.

111
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:32,000
No matter how anxious the Duchess may be,

112
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:34,520
would she really let her grandson
be intimate with a woman so soon?

113
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:38,480
To save herself,
she'd tell any outrageous lie!

114
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:40,680
Don't believe her. Don't!

115
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:44,000
Newlyweds are always inseparable.

116
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:46,160
We'll be living closely
as husband and wife.

117
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:48,920
How many moles I have on my body…

118
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:51,320
How could my own husband not know?

119
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:54,800
Shameless!

120
00:07:56,760 --> 00:08:00,600
Grandmother, she became Lady Wei Rao
and Lord Lu's wife.

121
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:03,240
Then what about me?
Who am I supposed to be?

122
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:07,600
I won't even be able to show my face
in public again.

123
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:11,320
You've always loved me most.

124
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:14,840
Can you really bear to see me
ruined for life, Grandmother?

125
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:19,040
I was wrong. I know I was wrong.
I don't want her dead anymore.

126
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:22,120
I only want to take back
my rightful place.

127
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:25,360
If Lu Zhuo really finds out,
I'll go confess myself.

128
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:27,520
I'll kneel and beg the Lu family.

129
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:29,800
They're a noble and distinguished family.

130
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:33,360
Would they really rather have
a woman who emptied chamber pots than me?

131
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:36,880
She gave up more than just her husband.

132
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:40,919
She even gave away the name
her own father gave her.

133
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:44,159
How is Rao supposed to live, Mother?

134
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:48,320
Mother, you've always
treasured Rao above all else.

135
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:50,560
You've cherished her for 18 years.

136
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:54,680
Can you really bear
to make her hide for the rest of her life,

137
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:57,000
never able to show her face again?

138
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:18,120
You showed no fear when plotting this.

139
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:22,320
And when you tried to silence me,
you didn't hesitate for a second.

140
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,600
From beginning to end,

141
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:26,680
you showed the Dowager Lady
no respect at all.

142
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:29,120
Dowager Lady, you know right from wrong.

143
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:31,320
You can clearly see
who's right and who's wrong.

144
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:37,040
I'm only an orphan asking you
to do what's best and give me justice.

145
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:45,240
You… All of you… This…

146
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:47,880
Dowager Lady! Dowager Lady!

147
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:51,640
For some reason, Lord Lu
is heading straight for the back garden.

148
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:55,840
Grandmother,
please grant Rao this one wish.

149
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:58,640
From now on, I'll obey your every word
and never defy you again.

150
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,320
I'll devote myself to my husband

151
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:01,840
and be a worthy principal wife
of the Duke's Residence.

152
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:04,640
I'll never make you worry
or feel disappointed again.

153
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:08,360
Mother, my brother
is watching from heaven.

154
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:13,680
He's watching how the Wei family
treats his own daughter.

155
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:17,000
Have you forgotten the vow you made?

156
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:19,720
You swore to protect,
cherish, and dote on her,

157
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:23,120
and never let her suffer
the slightest wrong. Mother…

158
00:10:33,040 --> 00:10:35,280
Mother, decide quickly.

159
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:37,000
We can't delay any longer.

160
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,600
Take her away.

161
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:05,280
My Lord, all the guests came to see you.

162
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,240
The others are manageable,

163
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:08,280
but those nobles
are proving quite difficult.

164
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:09,440
Please join us in the reception pavilion

165
00:11:09,520 --> 00:11:11,680
- and spare His Lordship the trouble.
- I can't go right now.

166
00:11:11,760 --> 00:11:12,800
Give my apologies to your lord.

167
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:15,440
If you don't come,
I won't know what to tell His Lordship.

168
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:18,480
Lord Lu! Lord Lu!

169
00:11:18,560 --> 00:11:19,560
My Lord!

170
00:11:19,640 --> 00:11:21,640
He seems to be heading toward
the Book Pavilion.

171
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:37,520
What's wrong?

172
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:39,280
I felt very dizzy just now.

173
00:11:40,400 --> 00:11:42,040
I went to rest against a tree

174
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:44,480
and came across a little green snake.

175
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,040
I'm fine now.

176
00:11:47,920 --> 00:11:49,680
- I'll take you to Begonia Court.
- No.

177
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:54,000
I'm not going.

178
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,160
Grandmother cares for me most.

179
00:11:56,680 --> 00:11:57,800
I don't want to frighten her.

180
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:02,080
I'll head back first.

181
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:06,160
Bitao, come help me.

182
00:12:17,040 --> 00:12:18,080
My Lord.

183
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:22,000
Tell Old Madam Wei

184
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:25,080
I'm feeling unwell and have returned to
the Duke's Residence to rest.

185
00:12:25,160 --> 00:12:27,120
- I'll visit again another day.
- Yes.

186
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:31,920
Let's go.

187
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:36,800
Let go of me!

188
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,640
Let me go!

189
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,360
- Let go!
- Lady Rao!

190
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,280
Lady Rao, calm down!

191
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:43,120
- Let me go!
- Lady Rao.

192
00:12:45,040 --> 00:12:46,200
Let go!

193
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:50,360
- You may all leave.
- Rao.

194
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:54,160
Quick, come untie her.

195
00:12:58,600 --> 00:13:00,000
- Rao.
- You're not my grandmother!

196
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:01,240
What are you doing?

197
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,160
- All these years,
- Rao!

198
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:04,560
you kept saying you loved me most!

199
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:06,600
- Lies! All lies!
- Rao!

200
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:08,760
- Calm down!
- If you truly loved me,

201
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:11,000
you wouldn't let some impostor
take my place,

202
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:13,200
then turn around and tie up
your own granddaughter!

203
00:13:13,280 --> 00:13:15,560
- Rao.
- How can you be so heartless?

204
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:19,680
Take her away.

205
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:24,720
Stop.

206
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:30,440
What's done can't be undone.

207
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:32,640
This is fate.

208
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:36,840
Whoever went through the wedding that day

209
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:42,160
is the daughter
married out of the Wei Residence

210
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:45,240
and my own granddaughter.

211
00:13:46,560 --> 00:13:49,120
If anyone else dares say otherwise,

212
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:52,680
they'll be cast out of the Wei family!

213
00:13:52,760 --> 00:13:54,440
- Mother!
- Grandmother!

214
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:56,680
- Grandmother!
- Mother!

215
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:01,920
Wei Rao, clean yourself up.

216
00:14:02,880 --> 00:14:04,600
Go see your husband.

217
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,480
Dowager Lady, I'll never forget

218
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:18,760
your great kindness.

219
00:14:26,640 --> 00:14:27,720
Please return the golden hairpin.

220
00:14:41,240 --> 00:14:42,360
Rao.

221
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:44,920
How can you speak
to Grandmother like that?

222
00:14:45,560 --> 00:14:47,240
Am I wrong?

223
00:14:49,560 --> 00:14:51,040
All these years,

224
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:54,160
you kept me locked up like a prisoner

225
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:56,200
just because you hated my mother.

226
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:59,000
You hated that she remarried
right after Father died.

227
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:00,600
Because of you,

228
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:04,520
I couldn't see Mother growing up
or have anything to do with her family.

229
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:06,840
Your precious treasure?

230
00:15:06,920 --> 00:15:09,800
I was nothing but a little dog you kept.

231
00:15:12,920 --> 00:15:14,640
You must hate me, don't you?

232
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:17,840
Even looking at me must hurt, right?

233
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:21,400
Yet you still had to raise me
and treat me well.

234
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:23,800
Otherwise, you'd have failed
your son who died so young!

235
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:25,720
Rao, that's enough!

236
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:27,720
You're afraid people
will call you heartless.

237
00:15:27,800 --> 00:15:28,640
Rao!

238
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:31,080
You're afraid they'll condemn you
behind your back.

239
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:33,360
It's all an act. You're a hypocrite!

240
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:34,480
Stop it!

241
00:15:35,400 --> 00:15:36,600
Mother!

242
00:15:38,800 --> 00:15:40,080
Please, stop.

243
00:15:40,160 --> 00:15:41,600
Rao, are you all right?

244
00:15:45,720 --> 00:15:46,680
Stop it.

245
00:15:50,680 --> 00:15:53,200
I struck a nerve, didn't I?

246
00:15:54,560 --> 00:15:57,760
You sided with an outsider
against your own granddaughter.

247
00:15:58,360 --> 00:16:01,280
Father won't rest in peace
after seeing this.

248
00:16:02,520 --> 00:16:04,080
I curse you.

249
00:16:04,640 --> 00:16:05,920
- I hate you!
- Rao!

250
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:08,120
Will you please stop?

251
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,160
Enough!

252
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:11,400
Stop breaking your grandmother's heart!

253
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:15,840
Mother.

254
00:16:16,520 --> 00:16:18,440
Please don't blame her
for feeling betrayed.

255
00:16:18,520 --> 00:16:20,440
But I don't understand either.

256
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:23,400
Why would you do this?

257
00:16:24,640 --> 00:16:26,920
I spoiled you too much.

258
00:16:27,760 --> 00:16:30,920
I indulged you
until you forgot your place.

259
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:33,760
You keep calling her a chamber-pot woman,

260
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:35,320
but the truth is…

261
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:38,800
You're nowhere near as clever as she is.

262
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:44,600
Do you know what she told me in this room?

263
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:50,160
Rao, get up. Please, get up.
The floor is cold.

264
00:17:12,560 --> 00:17:13,400
You…

265
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:15,560
You…

266
00:17:16,599 --> 00:17:18,800
I'm not really Lady Wei Rao.

267
00:17:19,319 --> 00:17:20,599
My name is A-Chou.

268
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:24,599
I'm just a servant
who empties chamber pots on the streets.

269
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:28,560
They found me to marry into
the Lu family in Lady Rao's place.

270
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:31,000
What…

271
00:17:32,600 --> 00:17:35,120
A… A substitute bride?

272
00:17:35,760 --> 00:17:39,200
How could they do something so reckless?

273
00:17:40,280 --> 00:17:43,000
Absurd. Absolutely absurd…

274
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:45,160
Dowager Lady, please don't upset yourself.

275
00:17:45,240 --> 00:17:46,800
I come from a humble background.

276
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:48,400
I'm no one of importance.

277
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:51,760
But even the lowliest creature
clings to life. I only want to live.

278
00:17:54,360 --> 00:17:55,320
Dowager Lady.

279
00:17:58,720 --> 00:18:01,960
The marriage between our families
was arranged by the Empress Dowager.

280
00:18:03,040 --> 00:18:04,640
If this secret gets out,

281
00:18:05,160 --> 00:18:06,400
the Duke of Ying and Earl
of Cheng'an's families

282
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:07,760
will become bitter enemies.

283
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:09,920
The Wei family will be guilty of
deceiving His Majesty.

284
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:11,440
It's a crime that can never be pardoned.

285
00:18:12,120 --> 00:18:13,720
If we don't want
the whole family executed,

286
00:18:14,640 --> 00:18:17,160
this secret must stay buried.

287
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:18,920
Not a word can get out.

288
00:18:21,680 --> 00:18:26,560
So I dared
to secure myself some protection.

289
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:29,520
Protection?

290
00:18:30,440 --> 00:18:34,280
I hid a silk handkerchief
among Lord Lu's belongings.

291
00:18:35,760 --> 00:18:39,240
It explains in detail
how I became the substitute bride.

292
00:18:40,560 --> 00:18:44,520
If she dies in the Wei Residence today,

293
00:18:44,600 --> 00:18:48,080
the Duke's Residence
will send men tomorrow to demand answers.

294
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:50,880
Sending a lowly servant
as a substitute bride

295
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:53,600
is an insult to the Lu family

296
00:18:53,680 --> 00:18:56,600
and a grave offense
against the Imperial Family!

297
00:18:57,320 --> 00:19:01,240
The entire household will die with you.

298
00:19:01,320 --> 00:19:03,680
They'll come demanding answers!

299
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:08,360
I was wrong about her!

300
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:12,280
That wretched woman
is far more cunning than I thought!

301
00:19:12,360 --> 00:19:13,840
Enough!

302
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:17,240
You kept indulging her reckless behavior

303
00:19:17,320 --> 00:19:20,640
and nearly got the entire family killed!

304
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:24,520
Are you satisfied now?

305
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:28,240
Mother.

306
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:30,720
She won't reveal the secret, will she?

307
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:33,720
She's a clever girl.

308
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:36,080
And she acts decisively.

309
00:19:36,960 --> 00:19:38,920
Didn't the servants say so?

310
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:42,880
She even managed to fool Lu Zhuo.

311
00:19:44,040 --> 00:19:46,600
As long as you don't push her too far,

312
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:49,920
she won't risk her own life.

313
00:19:51,160 --> 00:19:53,000
Grandmother only cares about the family.

314
00:19:53,520 --> 00:19:54,720
But what about my future?

315
00:19:55,400 --> 00:20:00,160
There can only be one Lady Wei Rao,

316
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:02,400
and she is the principal wife
of the Duke's Residence.

317
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:09,760
What you gave away with your own hands

318
00:20:10,360 --> 00:20:15,120
wasn't just your status
as the Wei family's cherished daughter.

319
00:20:15,200 --> 00:20:20,840
You also gave away
a powerful, high-ranking husband,

320
00:20:20,920 --> 00:20:23,400
and all the wealth and honor

321
00:20:23,480 --> 00:20:25,640
you would've enjoyed
for the rest of your life!

322
00:20:35,080 --> 00:20:36,560
It's fate.

323
00:20:37,640 --> 00:20:39,760
Fate.

324
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:45,360
I don't want to accept it,
but I have no choice.

325
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:47,600
And you…

326
00:20:49,360 --> 00:20:50,720
You…

327
00:20:52,760 --> 00:20:56,080
Mother, have mercy!

328
00:20:56,160 --> 00:20:59,080
Please leave your own granddaughter
some way to live! Mother!

329
00:21:02,160 --> 00:21:04,960
We could say she came from Yizhou,

330
00:21:05,040 --> 00:21:06,760
from the Dowager Lady's maternal family.

331
00:21:06,840 --> 00:21:09,480
Since she looks so much like Lady Rao,

332
00:21:10,080 --> 00:21:11,920
she brought the Dowager Lady comfort,

333
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:15,560
so the Dowager Lady took her
as a god-granddaughter.

334
00:21:16,160 --> 00:21:17,640
As long as we keep the servants in line,

335
00:21:17,720 --> 00:21:21,040
there shouldn't be any trouble.

336
00:21:24,640 --> 00:21:28,000
I lost my head and said things
that hurt you, Grandmother.

337
00:21:28,520 --> 00:21:29,560
I was wrong.

338
00:21:30,160 --> 00:21:31,640
I know I was wrong!

339
00:21:32,160 --> 00:21:34,400
I truly know I was wrong!

340
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:38,960
Mother! Mother!

341
00:21:39,040 --> 00:21:40,200
Mother.

342
00:21:41,280 --> 00:21:44,240
Never forget the lesson you learned today.

343
00:21:44,320 --> 00:21:47,480
Stay in your room and reflect on
what you've done.

344
00:21:47,560 --> 00:21:50,640
Don't cause any more trouble.

345
00:21:55,160 --> 00:21:56,920
Mother…

346
00:22:08,240 --> 00:22:11,000
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

347
00:22:11,080 --> 00:22:11,920
You may all leave.

348
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:18,840
Why don't you burn incense anymore?

349
00:22:21,360 --> 00:22:24,880
Before you were married,
you used an incense burner in your room,

350
00:22:24,960 --> 00:22:25,960
and even scented your clothes.

351
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:29,520
I heard you even had a special
incense cage made for your bedding

352
00:22:29,600 --> 00:22:32,040
and wouldn't sleep
until the bedding was fully scented.

353
00:22:35,320 --> 00:22:36,680
Yet since marrying into my family,

354
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:39,240
I haven't seen you use one even once.

355
00:22:40,400 --> 00:22:41,680
<i>He's suspicious.</i>

356
00:22:42,520 --> 00:22:45,760
Back home, I was very particular
and never settled for less.

357
00:22:46,280 --> 00:22:48,880
But now I'm married, and you've been ill.

358
00:22:49,720 --> 00:22:52,480
How could I care about
makeup, perfume, or incense?

359
00:22:52,560 --> 00:22:55,920
Besides, incense often contains
medicinal herbs.

360
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:57,680
I feared it might interfere
with your medicine.

361
00:22:57,760 --> 00:22:59,600
So I stopped using it.

362
00:23:00,400 --> 00:23:01,520
Is your hand better?

363
00:23:02,960 --> 00:23:05,520
Physician Zhao worked wonders.
It's much better.

364
00:23:07,400 --> 00:23:08,400
Qi Zhongkai.

365
00:23:13,360 --> 00:23:15,160
He's the second son
of the Marquis of Pingxi.

366
00:23:16,160 --> 00:23:17,080
We've always been close.

367
00:23:17,760 --> 00:23:20,720
He heard I'd recovered
and wants to hold a banquet for me.

368
00:23:20,800 --> 00:23:22,440
I've been feeling exhausted.

369
00:23:23,200 --> 00:23:24,840
I can't be bothered
with all that ceremony.

370
00:23:26,760 --> 00:23:28,040
Write back and politely decline for me.

371
00:24:13,280 --> 00:24:14,520
What's wrong?

372
00:24:15,360 --> 00:24:19,800
I'm not sure what rank Lord Qi holds
or how I should address him.

373
00:24:22,560 --> 00:24:24,120
He's General of Ningshuo.

374
00:24:25,120 --> 00:24:28,240
But when we write to each other,
I address him by his courtesy name.

375
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:29,800
Shunqin.

376
00:24:32,120 --> 00:24:32,960
Go ahead.

377
00:24:48,800 --> 00:24:49,720
My Lord.

378
00:24:53,400 --> 00:24:56,320
My Lord, the Dowager Lady
heard you were back.

379
00:24:56,400 --> 00:24:57,440
She wants you to see her at once.

380
00:25:03,960 --> 00:25:05,080
No rush.

381
00:25:18,400 --> 00:25:20,920
SHUN

382
00:25:23,200 --> 00:25:24,840
<i>Judging by her old handwriting,</i>

383
00:25:24,920 --> 00:25:27,440
<i>she must've been hot-tempered,</i>
<i>narrow-minded, and impulsive.</i>

384
00:25:27,520 --> 00:25:28,240
SHUNQIN

385
00:25:28,320 --> 00:25:31,720
<i>Her strokes are softer now,</i>
<i>and lack some strength.</i>

386
00:25:31,800 --> 00:25:32,800
<i>Similar, but not quite.</i>

387
00:25:33,800 --> 00:25:35,480
<i>But her right hand was injured before.</i>

388
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:38,720
My Lord.

389
00:25:39,760 --> 00:25:42,640
You are a noble lady
who grew up in comfort.

390
00:25:44,320 --> 00:25:45,720
Why do you have calluses

391
00:25:47,880 --> 00:25:49,160
and so many scars on your hands?

392
00:25:52,360 --> 00:25:53,560
Why won't you answer me?

393
00:25:58,400 --> 00:26:00,920
What secret are you hiding from me?

394
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:07,920
If you're still hiding anything,

395
00:26:10,000 --> 00:26:11,520
I won't forgive you.

396
00:26:21,400 --> 00:26:22,800
Why must you press me so hard?

397
00:26:23,320 --> 00:26:25,240
Don't you know my family background?

398
00:26:26,680 --> 00:26:29,160
My father's family isn't my only family.

399
00:26:30,520 --> 00:26:32,280
There's also my mother's family,
scorned by society.

400
00:26:34,240 --> 00:26:37,400
My maternal grandmother is Lady Shou'an,
His Majesty's former wet nurse.

401
00:26:37,480 --> 00:26:39,200
My own mother…

402
00:26:41,320 --> 00:26:42,160
She…

403
00:26:46,400 --> 00:26:48,520
Grandmother doesn't want me
seeing my mother's family.

404
00:26:50,280 --> 00:26:53,280
But Lady Shou'an
is my maternal grandmother.

405
00:26:53,360 --> 00:26:54,560
How could I not be close to her?

406
00:26:55,840 --> 00:26:59,880
She was born a farm girl
and often grew homesick and depressed.

407
00:27:00,440 --> 00:27:03,720
His Majesty granted her an estate
and farmland outside the capital.

408
00:27:04,960 --> 00:27:06,640
With my wedding approaching,

409
00:27:06,720 --> 00:27:08,400
I didn't know when I'd see her again.

410
00:27:08,920 --> 00:27:10,720
So I often visited her
behind Grandmother's back.

411
00:27:11,480 --> 00:27:14,280
I helped her raise silkworms
and weave cloth.

412
00:27:14,880 --> 00:27:17,160
Sometimes I'd even help with farm work.

413
00:27:17,760 --> 00:27:18,680
As for these scars…

414
00:27:22,720 --> 00:27:23,960
I was just being a busybody.

415
00:27:25,760 --> 00:27:26,600
You…

416
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:38,720
My Lady knew you weren't sleeping well,

417
00:27:38,800 --> 00:27:41,040
so she dried the herbs herself

418
00:27:41,120 --> 00:27:43,200
and stitched this herbal pillow by hand.

419
00:27:43,280 --> 00:27:46,720
That's how My Lady's hands
ended up with so many cuts.

420
00:27:46,800 --> 00:27:47,880
Stop right there.

421
00:27:49,240 --> 00:27:50,760
What else do you need, My Lord?

422
00:27:53,720 --> 00:27:55,800
Never mind. Leave it here.

423
00:27:57,200 --> 00:27:59,560
The herbs need to be dried again
every three days.

424
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:00,800
Bring it back after I've replaced them.

425
00:28:11,480 --> 00:28:12,760
Bring me a bamboo basket.

426
00:28:44,360 --> 00:28:46,640
<i>People don't change their true nature.</i>

427
00:28:46,720 --> 00:28:48,880
<i>No matter how beautiful this woman is</i>
<i>or how well she hides it,</i>

428
00:28:49,840 --> 00:28:52,880
<i>never forget how vicious and cruel</i>
<i>she was when she killed.</i>

429
00:28:53,640 --> 00:28:56,200
<i>Don't be fooled by a beautiful monster</i>
<i>in a pretty disguise.</i>

430
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:02,720
Do not disturb His Lordship
while he's reading.

431
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:32,240
Bitao, thank you for bringing Lord Lu.

432
00:29:32,320 --> 00:29:33,680
You got me out of a desperate situation.

433
00:29:33,760 --> 00:29:35,120
It was your quick thinking, My Lady,

434
00:29:35,200 --> 00:29:37,000
that got you safely out of
the Wei Residence.

435
00:29:37,600 --> 00:29:40,800
You even thought of
Lady Rao's old scar on her hand.

436
00:29:50,520 --> 00:29:52,200
I have something important to show you.

437
00:30:03,600 --> 00:30:04,440
This…

438
00:30:06,040 --> 00:30:07,920
This is my indenture contract.

439
00:30:08,000 --> 00:30:08,840
BITAO'S INDENTURE CONTRACT

440
00:30:09,560 --> 00:30:10,480
When I was in the room,

441
00:30:11,360 --> 00:30:13,360
I told Old Madam Wei everything.

442
00:30:13,920 --> 00:30:16,840
To appease me, she asked what I wanted.

443
00:30:17,440 --> 00:30:18,760
So I asked her for this.

444
00:30:18,840 --> 00:30:22,520
This is what masters use
to keep servants under their control.

445
00:30:24,080 --> 00:30:27,400
My Lady,
are you really willing to give it to me?

446
00:30:41,240 --> 00:30:43,320
BITAO

447
00:30:51,640 --> 00:30:52,640
There.

448
00:30:53,360 --> 00:30:55,480
No one can control you
with that contract anymore.

449
00:31:01,600 --> 00:31:02,520
Get up.

450
00:31:10,000 --> 00:31:11,600
SUBSTITUTION BRIDE, A DEFIED DECREE
THE HANDKERCHIEF STANDS AS PROOF

451
00:31:13,760 --> 00:31:15,440
My Lady, you know how to read?

452
00:31:16,240 --> 00:31:17,960
People from all walks of life
lived in our tenement.

453
00:31:18,920 --> 00:31:20,640
Literate storytellers,

454
00:31:21,240 --> 00:31:24,600
aging courtesans,
concubines and illegitimate sons

455
00:31:25,120 --> 00:31:26,520
cast out after the master
of the house died.

456
00:31:26,600 --> 00:31:28,360
I begged each one of them.

457
00:31:28,920 --> 00:31:30,880
Some kind souls would
teach me a thing or two.

458
00:31:31,680 --> 00:31:33,960
With no pen or ink,
I wrote with twigs in sand.

459
00:31:34,560 --> 00:31:36,680
After ten years,
I learned to read most things.

460
00:31:37,760 --> 00:31:38,840
To keep anyone from finding out,

461
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:42,520
I'd already practiced
copying Lady Rao's handwriting.

462
00:31:43,120 --> 00:31:45,920
After all that, My Lady,
you finally made it through.

463
00:31:47,280 --> 00:31:48,360
Silly girl.

464
00:31:51,720 --> 00:31:53,600
Even if Old Madam Wei lets me stay,

465
00:31:55,000 --> 00:31:58,360
Lady Wei Rao won't let this go.

466
00:31:59,560 --> 00:32:01,600
Lu Zhuo despises me,

467
00:32:01,680 --> 00:32:04,320
and the Lu family is a powerful clan
with too many eyes and ears.

468
00:32:04,840 --> 00:32:08,960
One wrong move,
and if anyone sees through me,

469
00:32:09,960 --> 00:32:11,320
I'll be the first to lose my head.

470
00:32:12,320 --> 00:32:13,640
Then what will you do, My Lady?

471
00:32:20,400 --> 00:32:21,680
No matter what,

472
00:32:24,400 --> 00:32:25,800
I have to secure my place

473
00:32:27,200 --> 00:32:28,640
in the Lu family.

474
00:32:43,120 --> 00:32:44,160
Madam.

475
00:32:50,800 --> 00:32:53,400
It seems you've won her trust.

476
00:32:54,240 --> 00:32:56,840
The fastest way to gain someone's trust

477
00:32:56,920 --> 00:32:59,480
is to share a secret
that dare not see the light.

478
00:33:00,160 --> 00:33:02,040
It's a shame about Governess Wu.

479
00:33:02,760 --> 00:33:06,200
Why pity such a fool?

480
00:33:07,120 --> 00:33:09,640
You handled this very well.

481
00:33:10,400 --> 00:33:12,200
What should I do next?

482
00:33:12,840 --> 00:33:14,080
Please instruct me, Madam.

483
00:33:15,960 --> 00:33:20,560
Just stay by her side and do nothing.

484
00:33:21,760 --> 00:33:23,200
When I need you,

485
00:33:23,800 --> 00:33:25,720
I'll make the arrangements.

486
00:33:28,160 --> 00:33:29,280
No matter what,

487
00:33:30,000 --> 00:33:31,440
I'll help you.

488
00:33:45,480 --> 00:33:46,480
I've found out everything.

489
00:33:47,080 --> 00:33:49,880
The Dowager Lady has trouble chewing
and loves golden osmanthus.

490
00:33:50,640 --> 00:33:53,840
These osmanthus cakes you made
are sure to please her.

491
00:33:59,160 --> 00:34:00,480
Rao.

492
00:34:00,560 --> 00:34:01,600
Have you lost your mind too?

493
00:34:01,680 --> 00:34:03,680
Why bow to that vicious woman?

494
00:34:07,760 --> 00:34:08,960
What?

495
00:34:09,040 --> 00:34:11,159
Have you gone mad, Changning?

496
00:34:11,239 --> 00:34:12,800
How dare you insult me!

497
00:34:12,880 --> 00:34:15,880
A noble lady who won't even greet
her elder sister-in-law,

498
00:34:16,400 --> 00:34:18,520
but calls her a vicious woman to her face?

499
00:34:19,719 --> 00:34:22,040
Either you've suddenly gone mad,
or no one ever taught you manners.

500
00:34:22,960 --> 00:34:24,639
Changhui seems perfectly well-mannered.

501
00:34:25,159 --> 00:34:26,760
So the problem must be you.

502
00:34:27,360 --> 00:34:28,760
You vicious witch!

503
00:34:28,840 --> 00:34:31,960
Pretty on the outside,
but rotten to the core!

504
00:34:32,040 --> 00:34:34,000
You were jealous of Hualou's
beauty and talent,

505
00:34:34,080 --> 00:34:36,440
so you shoved her down,
and nearly killed her!

506
00:34:37,520 --> 00:34:41,280
Keep shouting,
and I'll tell Grandmother and Aunt.

507
00:34:41,880 --> 00:34:44,639
Then let's see how you survive
in the Lu family.

508
00:34:45,360 --> 00:34:47,199
Sister, please stop.

509
00:34:48,199 --> 00:34:50,239
Why would I push her for no reason?

510
00:34:50,320 --> 00:34:53,239
Wasn't it because Hualou
had feelings for our cousin?

511
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:55,600
- Shh…
- So you got jealous and tried to kill her!

512
00:34:56,840 --> 00:35:00,200
So Lady Xie has feelings for my husband.

513
00:35:00,280 --> 00:35:01,520
Wei Rao!

514
00:35:02,800 --> 00:35:03,680
- My Lady!
- Rao!

515
00:35:03,760 --> 00:35:05,040
- Wei Rao! Let go!
- Rao!

516
00:35:05,120 --> 00:35:06,200
Wei Rao, let go!

517
00:35:12,560 --> 00:35:13,640
Wei Rao!

518
00:35:17,120 --> 00:35:18,160
Watch out!

519
00:35:26,120 --> 00:35:27,040
Lu Changning.

520
00:35:28,040 --> 00:35:29,120
Your behavior is disgraceful.

521
00:35:29,200 --> 00:35:30,760
Go copy the family rules 100 times!

522
00:35:31,360 --> 00:35:32,640
Brother!

523
00:35:32,720 --> 00:35:34,280
You're still defending that vicious woman?

524
00:35:34,360 --> 00:35:35,840
She clearly tried to hurt Hualou!

525
00:35:35,920 --> 00:35:38,440
I'm punishing you for your disrespect
and forgetting your place.

526
00:35:39,080 --> 00:35:40,320
Go kneel in the ancestral hall
for two more hours.

527
00:35:40,400 --> 00:35:41,640
Brother!

528
00:35:41,720 --> 00:35:44,600
Anyone who dares plead for her
can kneel with her!

529
00:35:46,840 --> 00:35:49,440
You vicious fraud!

530
00:35:50,080 --> 00:35:51,280
Sooner or later,
I'll expose you for what you are!

531
00:36:01,960 --> 00:36:03,200
What are you looking for?

532
00:36:04,480 --> 00:36:06,520
- Your fox tail.
- Shunqin.

533
00:36:07,640 --> 00:36:09,400
Enough with the fooling around.

534
00:36:09,920 --> 00:36:11,200
Weren't we here to talk business?

535
00:36:11,720 --> 00:36:12,920
Come over here now.

536
00:36:14,920 --> 00:36:16,400
We're all family here.
No need to send the ladies away.

537
00:36:16,920 --> 00:36:17,840
Sister-in-law, join us.

538
00:36:32,920 --> 00:36:34,000
These are all for me?

539
00:36:34,080 --> 00:36:35,920
Everything you picked
at the shop yesterday.

540
00:36:36,440 --> 00:36:37,800
I had them delivered.

541
00:36:38,680 --> 00:36:39,520
Thank you, My Lord.

542
00:36:41,680 --> 00:36:44,400
And thank you, General Qi,
for bringing them yourself.

543
00:36:59,200 --> 00:37:00,320
Everything's arranged?

544
00:37:01,120 --> 00:37:02,160
Don't worry.

545
00:37:02,840 --> 00:37:06,600
I recovered so quickly
thanks to Rao's devoted care.

546
00:37:08,560 --> 00:37:10,080
The Qixi Festival is in two days.

547
00:37:10,160 --> 00:37:11,560
The streets will be lively.

548
00:37:12,680 --> 00:37:13,640
I'll take you out.

549
00:37:17,920 --> 00:37:19,840
Grandmother ordered it. I can't disobey.

550
00:37:20,960 --> 00:37:22,280
You should get ready too.

551
00:37:23,120 --> 00:37:25,320
I'm glad you care, My Lord.

552
00:37:32,840 --> 00:37:34,720
They should die! All of them!

553
00:37:40,840 --> 00:37:41,840
Rao!

554
00:37:43,040 --> 00:37:44,200
Rao!

555
00:37:44,280 --> 00:37:45,440
Let me see.

556
00:37:45,520 --> 00:37:46,560
Did you hurt yourself?

557
00:37:46,640 --> 00:37:49,080
Aunt Heng'e, you have to help me.

558
00:37:50,280 --> 00:37:52,960
You want me to get you out?

559
00:37:53,520 --> 00:37:54,800
What are you planning?

560
00:37:56,280 --> 00:37:57,920
Grandmother thinks
if she keeps me locked up,

561
00:37:58,000 --> 00:37:59,520
there's nothing I can do?

562
00:38:00,160 --> 00:38:05,920
Unless that wretch
hides in the Duke's Residence forever,

563
00:38:06,680 --> 00:38:08,000
the moment she steps out,

564
00:38:09,920 --> 00:38:14,840
I'll send her right back
where she came from!

565
00:38:19,920 --> 00:38:22,960
SEVENTH DAY OF THE SEVENTH MONTH

566
00:38:35,040 --> 00:38:36,480
Doesn't this puppet look like Lu Zhuo?

567
00:38:36,560 --> 00:38:37,400
Looks like you.

568
00:38:42,520 --> 00:38:43,400
I know this area well.

569
00:38:43,920 --> 00:38:47,080
See? That fire performer
isn't even a tenth as good as me.

570
00:38:51,760 --> 00:38:53,040
There's a shop ahead
with delicious festival pastries.

571
00:38:53,120 --> 00:38:54,280
QIXI FESTIVAL PASTRY

572
00:38:54,360 --> 00:38:55,560
Miss, take a look.
Which ones would you like?

573
00:38:55,640 --> 00:38:57,160
I'll wrap them up for you.

574
00:38:57,240 --> 00:38:58,080
They look so fresh.

575
00:38:58,160 --> 00:38:59,920
They were all made today.

576
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:01,800
This one and this one.

577
00:39:01,880 --> 00:39:02,720
Of course.

578
00:39:05,040 --> 00:39:06,200
Here you are, Miss.

579
00:39:06,720 --> 00:39:07,880
Tonight, let me wish you good fortune.

580
00:39:08,520 --> 00:39:11,360
May these festival pastries
bless you with even greater wit and skill.

581
00:39:12,960 --> 00:39:13,840
Thank you, General Qi.

582
00:39:15,920 --> 00:39:17,440
What are you dawdling for?

583
00:39:17,520 --> 00:39:18,680
Aren't you going to
toss the fortune needle?

584
00:39:19,440 --> 00:39:20,600
It's just ahead.

585
00:39:23,320 --> 00:39:25,000
Zhuo, don't you have something
important to do?

586
00:39:25,080 --> 00:39:26,160
Go take care of it.

587
00:39:30,880 --> 00:39:31,920
Keep an eye on her.

588
00:39:40,440 --> 00:39:41,440
Come take a look.

589
00:39:41,960 --> 00:39:43,240
Fresh festival pastries.

590
00:39:43,760 --> 00:39:45,520
- Come take a look.
- You're not Wei Rao at all.

591
00:39:52,600 --> 00:39:54,440
Lu Zhuo went to war at 13.

592
00:39:54,520 --> 00:39:56,280
What would he know
about telling women apart?

593
00:39:57,160 --> 00:39:59,680
But I grew up
with 15 or 16 female cousins.

594
00:40:00,320 --> 00:40:02,400
I can spot your flaws easily.

595
00:40:09,080 --> 00:40:09,920
I'm listening.

596
00:40:10,760 --> 00:40:12,440
A pampered beauty like her
has snow-white skin.

597
00:40:12,520 --> 00:40:13,640
But you…

598
00:40:15,320 --> 00:40:17,640
Your eyes may be beautiful,
but your complexion gives you away.

599
00:40:18,280 --> 00:40:20,200
The real Wei Rao
has arched brows and piercing eyes,

600
00:40:20,280 --> 00:40:21,600
the look of someone proud and headstrong.

601
00:40:22,280 --> 00:40:24,320
Your eyes are lively and sharp,

602
00:40:24,400 --> 00:40:25,640
the look of someone clever and cunning.

603
00:40:26,360 --> 00:40:28,560
The real Wei Rao
moves with delicate grace.

604
00:40:28,640 --> 00:40:30,280
But your steps are firm and steady.

605
00:40:31,520 --> 00:40:33,560
You're clearly not the same person.

606
00:41:04,920 --> 00:41:07,480
Then look at my hand.
How is it different from hers?

607
00:41:12,280 --> 00:41:13,120
What are you doing?

608
00:41:13,200 --> 00:41:16,720
My husband considers you
a trusted comrade, a sworn brother.

609
00:41:16,800 --> 00:41:18,880
Yet while he's away,
you dare speak so rudely to his wife!

610
00:41:19,480 --> 00:41:21,360
You're not the only one
who can read faces.

611
00:41:21,880 --> 00:41:23,240
I can too!

612
00:41:24,800 --> 00:41:26,800
Your eyes are deep-set and hollow,
your brows slant and your eyes leer.

613
00:41:26,880 --> 00:41:28,760
You have the hungry stare of a lecher!

614
00:41:29,480 --> 00:41:31,880
So you're a shameless scoundrel,

615
00:41:31,960 --> 00:41:34,320
two-faced and treacherous,
trading honor for a woman's favor.

616
00:41:34,400 --> 00:41:35,240
How lecherous!

617
00:41:35,320 --> 00:41:37,480
How dare you stare at
your sister-in-law's figure?

618
00:41:37,560 --> 00:41:38,720
Have you no shame?

619
00:41:38,800 --> 00:41:40,360
You even dare flirt
with your sister-in-law?

620
00:41:40,440 --> 00:41:41,520
Absolutely shameless!

621
00:41:41,600 --> 00:41:44,760
Nonsense! I'm this handsome.
How are my brows and eyes crooked?

622
00:41:44,840 --> 00:41:45,720
You…

623
00:41:46,760 --> 00:41:48,880
Help! Someone's been killed
on East Street!

624
00:41:48,960 --> 00:41:50,680
Murder! Call the authorities!

625
00:41:51,200 --> 00:41:52,520
Just as expected.

626
00:41:53,200 --> 00:41:55,080
Lord Lu is injured. I need to help him.

627
00:41:55,600 --> 00:41:56,720
Protect Lady Lu.

628
00:42:52,240 --> 00:42:53,440
Retreat! Hurry!

629
00:42:58,800 --> 00:42:59,800
I've waited long enough for you.

630
00:42:59,880 --> 00:43:01,320
Where do you think you're going?

631
00:43:06,480 --> 00:43:07,680
Where is she?

632
00:43:07,760 --> 00:43:09,000
Didn't I tell you to watch her?

633
00:43:12,560 --> 00:43:13,640
Search over there.

634
00:43:21,800 --> 00:43:23,200
My Lady, they're gone.

635
00:43:30,440 --> 00:43:32,880
Qi Zhongkai is trouble too.

636
00:43:33,520 --> 00:43:36,840
I'll have to be even more careful
when dealing with him.

637
00:43:36,920 --> 00:43:38,640
Come take a look!

638
00:43:39,160 --> 00:43:40,800
Beautiful floating lanterns!

639
00:43:40,880 --> 00:43:41,800
My Lady, look.

640
00:43:41,880 --> 00:43:43,720
People are making wishes
with lanterns over there.

641
00:43:43,800 --> 00:43:46,520
- Come take a look!
- What a lively scene.

642
00:43:46,600 --> 00:43:48,720
Floating lanterns! Come see!

643
00:43:49,320 --> 00:43:51,240
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

644
00:43:51,320 --> 00:43:52,280
He's spitting fire!

645
00:43:52,360 --> 00:43:53,200
One more!

646
00:43:53,280 --> 00:43:55,200
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

647
00:43:55,280 --> 00:43:57,640
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

648
00:43:58,160 --> 00:43:59,920
Nothing for me here.

649
00:44:00,760 --> 00:44:01,880
Sure!

650
00:44:08,920 --> 00:44:13,120
<i>Heaven above,</i>
<i>please keep Mother and Hongxian safe.</i>

651
00:44:13,200 --> 00:44:14,600
Move! Get out of my way!

652
00:44:15,120 --> 00:44:16,320
- Move!
- Hurry!

653
00:44:16,400 --> 00:44:18,400
- My Lady!
- Everyone down there, get out!

654
00:44:19,040 --> 00:44:20,000
Who is that?

655
00:44:20,080 --> 00:44:21,160
Move!

656
00:44:25,120 --> 00:44:25,960
Get out!

657
00:44:26,600 --> 00:44:27,760
Move, now!

658
00:44:29,680 --> 00:44:31,840
Lady Rao! Lady Rao!

659
00:44:31,920 --> 00:44:32,920
- You can't do this!
- How dare you betray me!

660
00:44:33,000 --> 00:44:33,880
Bitao!

661
00:44:37,520 --> 00:44:39,400
Grab that wretched woman!

662
00:44:52,480 --> 00:44:54,520
Aren't you so clever?

663
00:44:54,600 --> 00:44:56,040
Don't you always have a trick
up your sleeve?

664
00:44:56,640 --> 00:44:57,800
You even fooled Grandmother
into believing you

665
00:44:57,880 --> 00:44:59,360
and locking me inside.

666
00:44:59,440 --> 00:45:00,480
You thought you could replace me

667
00:45:00,560 --> 00:45:02,560
and become the daughter-in-law
of the Duke's Residence?

668
00:45:02,640 --> 00:45:03,960
Dream on!

669
00:45:05,400 --> 00:45:08,040
If Lu Zhuo learns the wife he married

670
00:45:08,120 --> 00:45:11,160
is nothing but a filthy, lowborn
chamber-pot woman,

671
00:45:11,240 --> 00:45:12,520
he'll be sick to death!

672
00:45:13,200 --> 00:45:16,800
You fraud, stealing another woman's place!
Heaven made you lowborn.

673
00:45:16,880 --> 00:45:20,200
You should've known your place
and stayed in the gutter your whole life!

674
00:45:20,280 --> 00:45:22,840
You tried to steal a life
that was never yours.

675
00:45:22,920 --> 00:45:24,640
This is what you get!

676
00:45:25,160 --> 00:45:27,440
Die! Just die!

677
00:45:44,520 --> 00:45:45,400
She's not breathing.

678
00:46:51,000 --> 00:46:52,200
Look! What's happening over there?

679
00:46:52,280 --> 00:46:53,680
What happened?

680
00:46:53,760 --> 00:46:55,080
Did someone fall into the water?

681
00:46:56,120 --> 00:46:57,080
Lady Rao!

682
00:46:57,640 --> 00:46:58,760
Hurry! Hurry!

683
00:46:58,840 --> 00:46:59,680
Quick!

684
00:47:03,000 --> 00:47:04,200
- Over there!
- Hurry up!

685
00:47:04,280 --> 00:47:05,680
Hurry!

686
00:47:05,760 --> 00:47:06,760
Someone save her!

687
00:47:06,840 --> 00:47:08,160
You're noble! You're so important!

688
00:47:08,760 --> 00:47:10,240
Heaven gave you so much,

689
00:47:10,320 --> 00:47:11,680
yet you threw it all away!

690
00:47:11,760 --> 00:47:13,160
Now you want it back?

691
00:47:13,240 --> 00:47:14,840
You don't get to have it both ways!

692
00:47:14,920 --> 00:47:15,840
Want to see who wins?

693
00:47:15,920 --> 00:47:18,720
Me, who grew up fighting
through the gutter,

694
00:47:18,800 --> 00:47:20,680
or you, who grew up surrounded by luxury?

695
00:47:20,760 --> 00:47:22,280
Let's see which of us is harder to kill!

696
00:47:36,120 --> 00:47:39,040
Help! Somebody help!

697
00:47:39,120 --> 00:47:40,320
- My Lady!
- By the river!

698
00:47:40,400 --> 00:47:41,320
- My Lord!
- Somebody help!

699
00:47:41,400 --> 00:47:42,440
- My Lord!
- Murder!

700
00:47:43,640 --> 00:47:46,960
My Lord! Help! My Lord!

701
00:47:47,480 --> 00:47:48,520
My Lady!

702
00:47:50,720 --> 00:47:51,680
Don't say a word.

703
00:47:51,760 --> 00:47:54,000
If he finds out, we're both dead.

704
00:48:03,600 --> 00:48:05,160
- Over there.
- Be careful!

705
00:48:05,760 --> 00:48:06,800
Come on! Catch that!

706
00:48:08,360 --> 00:48:10,360
Here! Can you reach it?

707
00:48:11,960 --> 00:48:13,440
Grab on!

708
00:48:15,480 --> 00:48:16,520
Careful.

709
00:48:17,320 --> 00:48:18,400
Come on!

710
00:48:19,400 --> 00:48:20,440
My Lady.

711
00:48:22,600 --> 00:48:23,880
What happened?

712
00:48:25,800 --> 00:48:27,920
M-My Lady was here
releasing a lantern and praying

713
00:48:28,000 --> 00:48:29,160
when she was attacked by robbers.

714
00:48:29,240 --> 00:48:30,600
They weren't satisfied
with stealing her valuables.

715
00:48:30,680 --> 00:48:31,800
They tried to abduct My Lady too.

716
00:48:31,880 --> 00:48:34,440
But when they heard you were coming,
they got scared and fled.

717
00:48:34,520 --> 00:48:36,960
Have the city guards search
the entire city. Let's get back first.

718
00:48:37,760 --> 00:48:39,760
You're still injured. Let me.

719
00:48:40,680 --> 00:48:41,960
Clear the way!

720
00:48:51,400 --> 00:48:52,640
Make way! Make way!

721
00:51:10,760 --> 00:51:13,360
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
